<%= it.variant({
  claude: "",
  codex: "A worker is a spawned child kept alive across tasks — spawn it once with `spawn_agent`, then re-task it via `send_message` (worker still processing or holding at a checkpoint) or `resume_agent` (worker went dormant after its last report). There is no peer-to-peer channel between workers: they report only to you, and you relay contract state between them.\n\n",
  opencode: "A worker is a spawned child kept alive across tasks — spawn it once with `spawn_agent`, then re-task it via `send_message` (worker still processing or holding at a checkpoint) or `resume_agent` (worker went dormant after its last report). There is no peer-to-peer channel between workers: they report only to you, and you relay contract state between them.\n\n",
  antigravity: ""
}) %><placeholder-variables>
<%= it.variant({
  claude: "[MODEL] — LLM model for worker delegation, per `<model-selection>`\n",
  codex: "[EFFORT] — Exploration depth briefed to a worker, chosen by the work's complexity, per `<effort-selection>`\n",
  opencode: "[EFFORT] — Exploration depth briefed to a worker, chosen by the work's complexity, per `<effort-selection>`\n",
  antigravity: "[MODEL] — LLM model for worker delegation, per `<model-selection>`\n"
