  antigravity: "Cross-package contracts (types, wire shapes, storage layouts) are yours to decide and state explicitly in each worker's dispatch prompt — do not let two workers negotiate a shared boundary. Verify a stated contract at the `REPORT:` that touches it, not at the gate: diff the reported contract files against the `## Contract` in every consuming worker's brief; `REVISE:` the deviator.\n"
}) %>
